# Dependencies (pnpm only; pnpm-lock.yaml is committed)
node_modules/

# Docs/comparison/ is its own pnpm root and installs six frameworks purely to
# measure them. Committing its lockfile puts all six transitive trees into the
# repository's dependency graph — which is the thing that directory exists to
# avoid, and which makes an advisory in someone else's framework block an
# unrelated PR. Its package.json pins every direct version exactly, and
# COMPARISON.md lists them, which is what the rows are measured against.
Docs/comparison/pnpm-lock.yaml
.pnpm-store/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

